Scene-R1 public inference and geometry release

This distribution retains the Apache License 2.0 text supplied with the
Scene-R1 baseline archive. The original baseline README acknowledges:
  Time-R1 / TimeZero: https://github.com/xiaomi-research/Time-R1
The baseline training sources also retain Hugging Face copyright notices;
those training sources are not included in this focused release.

The single-example model interface is adapted from the baseline Scene-R1
Qwen2.5-VL inference flow. Dataset evaluation loops were not retained.
The geometry/import adapter is a cleaned implementation of the extended
release's candidate-matching interface, with explicit validation and fallbacks.
These adaptations are not presented as the exact code used for paper results.

External dependencies (not copied into this distribution):
  SAI3D: https://github.com/yd-yin/SAI3D
  Semantic-SAM: https://github.com/UX-Decoder/Semantic-SAM
  SAM2: https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2
  Qwen2.5-VL: https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen2.5-VL
  Transformers: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers

No model checkpoints, raw datasets, benchmark predictions, third-party
reports, or upstream SAI3D/Semantic-SAM source trees are redistributed here.
Consult each maintainer's terms; the Apache license here does not relicense
external code, checkpoints, data, images, or annotations.
